---
// Hero — centered editorial statement with registration marks, monogram,
// and a live São Paulo clock.
---

<header class="hero" id="top" data-hero>
  <canvas class="hero-rain" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <span class="reg tl"></span>
  <span class="reg tr"></span>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="monogram" aria-hidden="true">GA</div>
    <h1
      class="i18n"
      data-en="I design and build <em>web products.</em>"
      data-pt="Eu projeto e construo <em>produtos web.</em>"
    >
      I design and build <em>web products.</em>
    </h1>
    <p
      class="i18n"
      data-en="I'm Gabriel Andrade, a <b>design engineer</b> from São Paulo. Five years turning interfaces into shipped products, from the Figma file to production, with real care for craft, motion, and accessibility."
      data-pt="Sou Gabriel Andrade, <b>design engineer</b> de São Paulo. Cinco anos transformando interfaces em produtos no ar, do arquivo no Figma até a produção, com cuidado real por craft, movimento e acessibilidade."
    >
      I'm Gabriel Andrade, a <b>design engineer</b> from São Paulo. Five years turning interfaces
      into shipped products, from the Figma file to production, with real care for craft, motion,
      and accessibility.
    </p>
    <ul class="hero-stats mono" aria-label="Track record">
      <li><b>5</b><span class="i18n" data-en="years shipping" data-pt="anos entregando">years shipping</span></li>
      <li><b>1,000+</b><span class="i18n" data-en="screens" data-pt="telas">screens</span></li>
      <li><b>200+</b><span class="i18n" data-en="product flows" data-pt="fluxos de produto">product flows</span></li>
      <li><b>1</b><span class="i18n" data-en="design system, from scratch" data-pt="design system, do zero">design system, from scratch</span></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="meta-strip">
      <span>SÃO PAULO, BR</span>
      <span class="sep"></span>
      <time id="clock" aria-label="Local time in São Paulo">--:--:--</time>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
